quest to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. The incident was already there, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n- **Follow-up:** The root cause of the v2.3.1 failure is still unknown. The orchestrator partial failure also needs investigation. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it has been verified healthy.", "type": "text"}]}]}